  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Infrastructure Program</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Infraestructura</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de esta operacin es contribuir a la reactivacin econmica y mejorar la calidad de vida de la poblacin de Hait, por medio de proyectos de alto impacto de rehabilitacin de infraestructura econmica bsica.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this operation is to contribute to the reactivation of economic activity and the improvement of peoples quality of life in Haiti, through high-impact projects of rehabilitation of basic economic infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
